                "text": "I\u2019m testifying before @NRDems this AM on my bill to stop the approval of Mountaintop Removal Mining permits until a federally-funded health study is complete. People in coal country deserve answers on what effect this reckless practice has on their health. https://t.co/sVOxd2m8M6",
