                "text": "Coal companies have ravaged our mountaintops for more than 50yrs without a single federal study of the health effects on surrounding communities. Proud to testify at @NRDems today to call for a halt to all new MTR mining permits until a study is done. KY families deserve answers. https://t.co/XiKJwZ12hb",
